  (wire (pts (xy 294.64 121.92) (xy 292.1 121.92)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "17a31012-b370-4b00-9244-935df29810ea"))
  (label "VB" (at 292.1 121.92 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "a7a3e79c-a9d8-461b-b14f-1848eeaa372e"))
  (text "Medir con el multímetro en V= contra el pin 1 (GND)" (at 290 138 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b5bde867-da01-433c-a048-30aa7fa3faf3"))
  (text "NOTAS" (at 290 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1dee003f-ced5-4786-be83-26badd2bdf22"))
  (text "1. Valores del montaje validado: Rb = 100 Ω, Rf = 30 kΩ, Rg = 10 kΩ, Cg = 10 µF, R3 = 1 kΩ." (at 290 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05c259ec-788b-4c16-a06e-19fa0b24ad4b"))
  (text "2. Ganancia en AC G = 1 + Rf/Rg = 4; en DC G = 1 (Cg bloquea), así la salida se centra en V_B." (at 290 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b98db42a-3580-4fdc-b86d-f09aa4567c00"))
  (text "3. Esquina de Rg–Cg: fc = 1/(2π·10k·10µ) ≈ 1,6 Hz." (at 290 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0e27446b-dfd3-40b5-8cf2-bd4115c1464e"))
  (text "4. C5 y C6 son opcionales (1 nF); sin ellos el circuito queda igual al validado." (at 290 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe5e26ca-db49-407d-874d-4cbdfeefc6d9"))
  (text "5. El módulo ZMPT va a 5 V fijo (JP1 se quitó en la v3: con el divisor 10k/20k solo sirve a 5 V)." (at 290 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da91ccf4-006a-4142-8372-fef396b8e306"))
  (text "6. Verificar con la serigrafía del Nucleo que A0, A1, A3, D0, D1, 5V, 3V3 y GND coinciden." (at 290 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "68fbeed6-42e2-4073-a5bc-e38457cf7fd8"))
  (text "7. v3: canal de corriente en U1B (5 +, 6 −, 7 salida); seguidor en U1A. Mismo circuito, otra mitad del LM358." (at 290 195 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4c9c7f85-a077-4577-9cb4-638eee8bc5f7"))
  (text "8. J4 (prueba) en orden AV, GND, AI, IOUT, VB para poder rutear en una sola capa." (at 290 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a09eb79-6d52-4628-b8b3-2f38d50a944b"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
